---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="What We Do" description="Free Torah audio lessons, WhatsApp groups, and a place to give.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
      <h1>What We Do</h1>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p>Trust Hashem publishes recorded shiurim so anyone can learn Bitachon and Emunah from the sources taught on this site: Shaar Habitachon, the Beis HaLevi, Bilvavi, RaMCHaL, Chovos HaLevavos, and related sefarim.</p>
      <p>Each series has its own page, audio playlist, and WhatsApp group. The lessons are offered freely. Donations through PayPal help the work continue.</p>
      <p><a href="/library/">See the library</a> · <a href="/contact-us/">Ask for a group</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
